### 1. LOGIN TO GET TOKEN
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@imovies.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. CREATE THEATER
POST http://localhost:5000/api/theaters
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhZTBkMDNiMDgyMjI1NjdmNzFjOTU2NCIsImlhdCI6MTc5MzExOTE4NywiZXhwIjoxNzk1NzExMTg3fQ._4pkLYZsklTap1-yqCVR3elmZ_2gWSUiiNxkTEK7ruY

